        ex:hasText "By proposing these measures, our company's can demonstrate our company's commitment to reducing energy consumption and using low-carbon infrastructure, aligning with the client's requirements and expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval, serving the Belval region with 1200 beds and a staff of 4500 medical and care professionals, aims to improve the efficiency of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval, serving the Belval region with 1200 beds and a staff of 4500 medical and care professionals staff and the quality and safety of care provided to patients through the implementation of an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company proposes a comprehensive solution that meets these needs by providing an intelligent assistance tool that supports hospital staff in hospital staff clinical and administrative activities. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution is designed to fit into existing practices, ensuring no rupture in clinical or administrative workflows. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will assist staff in analyzing and managing dossiers, surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will also support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A) and facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing and efficient resumption of handling by another professional. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution must comply with regulatory standards, including GDPR and medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company ensures strict compliance with regulatory standards, including GDPR and medical confidentiality, guaranteeing data sovereignty and the protection of sensitive health data through encryption and pseudonymization where relevant. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will be hosted on infrastructure with French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, ensuring high levels of security and compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company approach optimizes costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company propose a progressive rollout, starting with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter, followed by progressive generalization to all services." ;
