        ex:hasText "This ensures that an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution is tailored to the specific needs of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval, serving the Belval region with 1200 beds and a staff of 4500 medical and care professionals and minimizes potential disruptions." ;
